## Controlled blinded depth test — future work

### Stage 0 — bark admission pair

- **A / BARK−:** full V4 minus 10 uL Cinnamon Bark EO + 10 uL DPG.
- **B / BARK+:** full V4 with 10 uL NYSUPPLY Cinnamon Bark EO 10%.

Retain B only if warm-seed plausibility and shell-to-seed continuity improve without cinnamon candy, pastry, harshness, or reduced cardamom leadership. A null or discordant result is `HOLD / NON-INFORMATIVE`; it does not validate the engine's missing-data zero.

### Stage 1 — restored-depth 2 x 2

Keep a 5,430 uL protected nucleus constant. Omitted module volume is replaced one-for-one with DPG; all arms total 6,000 uL raw concentrate.

- **PERSPECTIVE+ = 230 uL:** Hedione HC 120 + Dihydro Beta Ionone 70 + Suederal 10% 30 + Scentenal 0.1% 10. Tests rear air, soft interior, garment pressure, and metallic perimeter as one front/interior perspective module.
- **BURIED-RAILS+ = 340 uL:** Cedramber 100 + Clearwood 60 + Vertofix 100 + Amberwood F 80. Tests whether four low-modeled structural rails create rear depth and recurrence rather than generic woody mass.

| Arm | Protected nucleus | PERSPECTIVE+ | BURIED-RAILS+ | DPG replacement | Total concentrate |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| A / 00 lineage-compressed control | 5430 | 0 | 0 | 570 | 6000 |
| B / 10 | 5430 | 230 | 0 | 340 | 6000 |
| C / 01 | 5430 | 0 | 340 | 230 | 6000 |
| D / 11 full lineage-locked V4 | 5430 | 230 | 340 | 0 | 6000 |

Prepare each arm as a complete 6,000 uL master so no ingredient is scaled below the 10 uL measurement floor. For each coded 3 mL sample, take 600 uL of its master + 2,400 uL ethanol. Use two independently prepared master sets, anonymous random codes, balanced presentation order, and a sealed key. Same-master duplicate pours measure read consistency, not independent compounding reproducibility.

Read at 0, 5, 30, and 120 minutes, then 6 and 24 hours. Record free description first; then score LNDL identity, cardamom leadership, cold shell, lavender hinge, warm seed plausibility, shell-to-seed continuity, violet-suede complexion, cedar/vetiver verticality, rear depth, airy/dense simultaneity, texture, late cardamom echo, tailored style, overall liking, muddiness, woody-wall takeover, leather drift, lipstick drift, pastry/candy drift, harshness, and fatigue.

Identity loss rejects an arm before abstract depth. A stronger arm is not automatically deeper or better liked. A null or discordant module is `HOLD / NON-INFORMATIVE` at this dose and protocol.

### Stage 2 — lineage result test

Only after Stage 1 identifies surviving depth modules, compare the winning high-count successor against Nocturne V3 and the Chiaroscuro governed build at matched concentration under hidden ingredient counts. Equal-or-better depth requires improved target-linked spatiality, texture, transition, recurrence, and/or liking without lower LNDL identity. Until that physical comparison, V4 is structurally non-compressed in design but not proven sensorially superior.

