## Final claim ceiling

V4 passes the source-lineage conservation gate on documented design counts and functions. It has not been physically compounded or smelled. No physical similarity, liking, hedonism, luxury, complexity, depth, three-dimensionality, balance, safety, stability, diffusion, longevity, maturation, or release claim is established.
